  "body": "## Protect private forks when deleting repositories\r\n\r\n`gh repo delete` now warns when deleting a private or internal repository will also delete its forks. The additional confirmation is required even with `--yes`.\r\n\r\nNon-interactive workflows and agents must explicitly accept the cascading deletion:\r\n\r\n```shell\r\ngh repo delete OWNER/REPO --yes --accept-cascading-deletion-of-private-forks\r\n```\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n\r\n### ✨ Features\r\n\r\n* Require confirmation before `gh repo delete` deletes private forks by @BagToad in [#14858](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14858)\r\n\r\n### 🐛 Fixes\r\n\r\n* fix(auth status): surface underlying rate-limit, server, and network errors in terminal output by @babakks and @Copilot in [#15009](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15009)\r\n* fix(auth): skip token refresh when `gh`'s state directory is not writable by @babakks in [#14845](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14845)\r\n\r\n### 📚 Docs & Chores\r\n\r\n* Use REST to apply issue triage labels by @BagToad in [#15041](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15041)\r\n* Prevent repeated Dependabot triage assessments by @BagToad in [#15002](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15002)\r\n* Apply issue triage labels directly by @BagToad in [#15001](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15001)\r\n* Provide verified build versions to issue triage by @BagToad in [#15000](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15000)\r\n* Use a synthetic namespace for triage fixtures by @BagToad in [#14976](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14976)\r\n* Remove the accidental issue-triage model pin by @BagToad in [#14972](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14972)\r\n* Add a fake GitHub API runner for reproductions by @BagToad in [#14951](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14951)\r\n* Clarify which hosts use `GH_ENTERPRISE_TOKEN` by @BagToad in [#14918](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14918)\r\n* Regenerate triage workflows with `gh-aw` v1.0.1 by @tidy-dev in [#14910](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14910)\r\n* Test the `ShowRefs` option separator by @BagToad in [#14879](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14879)\r\n* Fix local extension-install test path normalization by @bobrik in [#14854](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14854)\r\n* Save Go caches only from trunk by @williammartin in [#14840](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14840)\r\n* Add a private vulnerability report form by @BagToad in [#14825](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14825)\r\n* Replace `msgpack` with a minimal node ID encoder by @tj-smith47 in [#14801](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14801)\r\n* Test the Git client with real repositories by @williammartin in [#14348](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14348)\r\n\r\n### :dependabot: Dependencies\r\n\r\n* chore(deps): bump `github.com/klauspost/compress` from 1.20.3 to 1.20.4 by @dependabot in [#15040](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15040)\r\n* chore(deps): bump `charm.land/lipgloss/v2` from 2.0.6 to 2.1.0 by @dependabot in [#15039](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15039)\r\n* chore(deps): bump Go toolchain from 1.27.3 to 1.27.4 by @github-actions[bot] in [#15028](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15028)\r\n* chore(deps): bump `golang.org/x/sys` from 0.49.0 to 0.50.0 by @dependabot in [#15010](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15010)\r\n* chore(deps): bump `golang.org/x/sync` from 0.24.0 to 0.25.0 by @dependabot in [#14998](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14998)\r\n* chore(deps): bump the `codeql-actions` group across 1 directory with 3 updates by @dependabot in [#14964](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14964)\r\n* chore(deps): bump `github.com/spf13/pflag` from 1.0.10 to 1.1.0 by @dependabot in [#14963](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14963)\r\n* chore(deps): bump `github.com/yuin/goldmark` from 1.8.6 to 1.8.7 by @dependabot in [#14907](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14907)\r\n* chore(deps): bump `charm.land/bubbletea/v2` from 2.1.0 to 2.1.1 by @dependabot in [#14906](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14906)\r\n* chore(deps): bump `github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go` from 1.3.0 to 1.4.0 by @dependabot in [#14905](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14905)\r\n* chore(deps): bump `google.golang.org/grpc` from 1.84.0 to 1.85.0 by @dependabot in [#14878](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14878)\r\n* chore(deps): bump the `codeql-actions` group with 3 updates by @dependabot in [#14824](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14824)\r\n\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @tj-smith47 made their first contribution in https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14801\r\n* @bobrik made their first contribution in https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14854\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/cli/cli/compare/v2.103.3...v2.104.0",
